<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius rupee stable on dollar, firms on pound.</title>
<headline>Mauritius rupee stable on dollar, firms on pound.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee was unchanged against the dollar but firmed versus the pound on Thursday, commercial banks forex dealers said.</p>
<p>Against the dollar, the rupee was quoted unchanged from Wednesday's mean commercial rate of 20.557. The rupee was fixed at a mean of 31.961 for one pound from 31.991 on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
